# Clone OS — Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` (and `.env.local` if needed) and fill in the values.

## Database (Neon PostgreSQL)
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST-pooler.REGION.aws.neon.tech/DBNAME?sslmode=require"
DIRECT_DATABASE_URL="postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST.REGION.aws.neon.tech/DBNAME?sslmode=require"

## NextAuth
NEXTAUTH_SECRET="generate with: openssl rand -hex 32"
NEXTAUTH_URL="http://localhost:3000"

## Public socket.io URL (for Vercel — leave empty to use the Space-z.ai gateway)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SOCKET_URL=""

## Real admin (used by scripts/seed.ts to create the real admin user)
ADMIN_EMAIL="you@example.com"
ADMIN_PASSWORD="generate a strong random password"

## z-ai-web-dev-sdk (used by the clone-chat mini-service)
ZAI_API_KEY=""
